WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.177
A minimal pair differs by one speech sound, such as ship/sheep; distinguishing that

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:07.475
sound helps decoding and clear meaning.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.294
Which words differ by just one vowel sound? Answer: ship and sheep

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:18.128
Sort minimal pairs by changed sound, then use new digraph words in original

00:00:18.128 --> 00:00:18.514
sentences.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:23.953
Ship /ɪ/ and sheep /iː/ differ in a vowel.
